base condition in resursion :
- condition where our resursion will stop making new calls

if no base condition - function call will keep happening , stack will be filled again and again 

if you are callinf a function again and again , you can treat it as a seperate call in the stack
 

what is recursion ? 
function which calls itself

why recursion ?
 - it helps us in solving the complex problems in a simple way
 - you can convert the recursion solution into iteration and vice versa 
 - space complexity is not constant because of recursive calls 
 - it helps in breaking down the bigger problems into smaller problems 
 
